    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">360‑Degree Digital Condition Audit</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Capture high‑resolution photos and video of the vehicle’s exterior, interior, and undercarriage using a mobile app. Log mileage, VIN, and any existing dents or scratches. Upload the audit to a shared portal so the car carrier truck India team and the receiving rail yard can verify the vehicle’s state before loading.</p>
